<p>
	Of course, more dictionaries are desired, such as those from non-Chinese nations. The aim is to make immersive learning of Literary Chinese through dictionaries as easy as possible within modern pedagogical frameworks, whilst also promoting scholarly study. 
</p>

<h2>Text Submission</h2>
<div data-controller="corpus-submission-ticket"
     data-corpus-submission-ticket-source-value="homepage"
     data-corpus-submission-ticket-parent-path-value=""
     data-corpus-submission-ticket-lock-parent-path-value="false">
  <p>Want to add a new text to the corpus? This creates a review ticket rather than writing straight into the corpus.</p>
  <p><button type="button" class="corpus-btn corpus-btn-primary" data-action="corpus-submission-ticket#toggle">Submit a text</button></p>

  <div class="cv-text-edit-panel cv-submission-panel hidden" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="panel">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Submit a new text (creates a ticket)</h3>
    <p class="cv-hint">Use a parent path like <code>越南漢文/clean</code> or <code>越南漢文/clean/皇黎一統志</code>. The new text will still be placed inside a fresh work folder.</p>

    <form data-action="submit->corpus-submission-ticket#submit">
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Parent clean directory</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input cv-mono" placeholder="e.g. 越南漢文/clean" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="parentPath" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Work folder</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="workFolder" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Ticket title</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" value="Corpus text submission" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="title" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Short summary</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="summary" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Text type</label>
        <select class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="textType">
          <option value="source">Source text</option>
          <option value="kanbun">Kanbun</option>
          <option value="hanmun">Hanmun</option>
          <option value="hanvan">Hanvan</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>NATION</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="nation" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>WORK_TITLE</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="workTitle" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>AUTHOR</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="author" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>SOURCE</label>
        <input type="text" class="cv-input" placeholder="Write a reference here (ideally APA 7th)" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="sourceCitation" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>URL</label>
        <input type="url" class="cv-input" placeholder="https://..." data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="url" />
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Context and rights</label>
        <textarea class="cv-textarea" rows="4" placeholder="Explain where this text is from, whether it is public domain, what licence applies, and any context a reviewer should know." data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="contextDetails"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Reference files</label>
        <input type="file" class="cv-input" multiple data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="uploads" />
        <div class="cv-hint">Up to 10 files and 20 MB in total. HTML, XHTML, and SVG are rejected.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-form-row">
        <label>Page setup</label>
        <select class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="pageMode" data-action="change->corpus-submission-ticket#togglePageMode">
          <option value="single">Single text file</option>
          <option value="multi">Multiple page files</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="singleFields">
        <div class="cv-form-row">
          <label>File name</label>
          <input type="text" class="cv-input" placeholder="Defaults to work_folder.txt" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="fileName" />
        </div>
        <div class="cv-form-row">
          <label>PAGE_TITLE</label>
          <input type="text" class="cv-input" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="pageTitle" />
        </div>
        <div class="cv-form-row">
          <label>Text body</label>
          <textarea class="cv-textarea cv-mono" rows="16" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="body"></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="multiFields" hidden>
        <div class="cv-form-row">
          <label>Pages</label>
          <div data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="pagesList"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cv-form-actions">
          <button type="button" class="corpus-btn" data-action="corpus-submission-ticket#addPage">Add page</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <%= render "corpus_viewer/ticket_optional_fields",
                 stimulus_controller: "corpus-submission-ticket",
                 include_uploads: false %>
      <div class="cv-form-actions">
        <button type="submit" class="corpus-btn corpus-btn-primary">Submit ticket</button>
        <button type="button" class="corpus-btn" data-action="corpus-submission-ticket#toggle">Close</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div class="cv-ticket-result">
      <div class="cv-ticket-status" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="status"></div>
      <div class="cv-ticket-kv">
        <div><strong>Ticket ID:</strong> <span data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="ticketId"></span></div>
        <div><strong>Ticket key (save this):</strong> <code data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="ticketKey"></code> <button type="button" class="corpus-btn" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="copyKeyBtn" data-action="corpus-submission-ticket#copyKey">Copy</button> <button type="button" class="corpus-btn" data-corpus-submission-ticket-target="downloadKeyBtn" data-action="corpus-submission-ticket#downloadKey" hidden>Download .txt</button></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>來想 Future Plans</h2>
<p>
	There are hopes to enable editing of this corpus to the public through an in-browser Pull Request system, which will be launched as the site backend improves. This will include edits to texts (correcting OCR/scribal errors, punctuation, etc), adding blurbs/synopses/summaries, and metadata details (authorship, time period, nation, etc). 
</p>

